#: ../../source/mp/observability/traces.rst:2
msgid "Tracing"
msgstr "追踪"

#: ../../source/mp/observability/traces.rst:6
msgid ""
"``--enable-tracing`` **requires** ``--otlp-endpoint`` to be set. The "
"server will refuse to start if tracing is enabled without an OTLP "
"endpoint, since there is no local fallback for trace export."
msgstr ""
"``--enable-tracing`` **要求** 设置 ``--otlp-endpoint``\\ 。如果启用追踪但没有 OTLP "
"端点，服务器将拒绝启动，因为没有本地回退用于追踪导出。"

#: ../../source/mp/observability/traces.rst:10
msgid ""
"When tracing is enabled (``--enable-tracing --otlp-endpoint <URL>``), the"
" tracing subscriber creates OTel spans from START/END event pairs:"
msgstr ""
"当启用追踪时（\\ ``--enable-tracing --otlp-endpoint <URL>``\\ ），追踪订阅者从 START/END"
" 事件对创建 OTel spans："

#: ../../source/mp/observability/traces.rst:13
msgid "``mp.store`` — from ``MP_STORE_START`` to ``MP_STORE_END``"
msgstr "``mp.store`` — 从 ``MP_STORE_START`` 到 ``MP_STORE_END``"

#: ../../source/mp/observability/traces.rst:14
msgid "``mp.retrieve`` — from ``MP_RETRIEVE_START`` to ``MP_RETRIEVE_END``"
msgstr "``mp.retrieve`` — 从 ``MP_RETRIEVE_START`` 到 ``MP_RETRIEVE_END``"

#: ../../source/mp/observability/traces.rst:15
msgid ""
"``mp.lookup_prefetch`` — from ``MP_LOOKUP_PREFETCH_START`` to "
"``MP_LOOKUP_PREFETCH_END``"
msgstr ""
"``mp.lookup_prefetch`` — 从 ``MP_LOOKUP_PREFETCH_START`` 到 "
"``MP_LOOKUP_PREFETCH_END``"

#: ../../source/mp/observability/traces.rst:17
msgid ""
"Each span carries event metadata as span attributes (e.g. ``device``, "
"``stored_count``, ``found_count``)."
msgstr ""
"每个 span 携带事件元数据作为 span 属性（例如 ``device``\\ 、\\ ``stored_count``\\ 、\\ "
"``found_count``\\ ）。"

#: ../../source/mp/observability/traces.rst:20
msgid ""
"View traces in any OTel-compatible backend such as **Jaeger** or "
"**Grafana Tempo**."
msgstr "在任何与 OTel 兼容的后端中查看追踪，例如 **Jaeger** 或 **Grafana Tempo**\\ 。"

#: ../../source/mp/observability/traces.rst:36
msgid "Per-Request Hit-Rate Attributes"
msgstr "每个请求的命中率属性"

#: ../../source/mp/observability/traces.rst:38
msgid ""
"Each session is wrapped in a per-request root span — ``request`` for the "
"standard MP path and ``cb.request`` for the CacheBlend path — that nests "
"all child spans (``mp.store``, ``mp.retrieve``, ``mp.lookup_prefetch``) "
"beneath it.  When the lookup phase ends, the root span is annotated with "
"OTel attributes that summarise the request-level cache hit rate.  Both "
"root spans carry the first three below; the rest are specific to the "
"``request`` span, and ``cb.request`` instead carries its own CacheBlend "
"breakdown of ``hit_tokens`` (prefix / segmented-prefix / non-prefix)."
msgstr "每个会话都被包装在一个每个请求的根跨度中——标准 MP 路径的 ``request`` 和 CacheBlend 路径的 ``cb.request``——它嵌套了所有子跨度（``mp.store``、``mp.retrieve``、``mp.lookup_prefetch``）。当查找阶段结束时，根跨度会用 OTel 属性进行注释，以总结请求级别的缓存命中率。两个根跨度都携带以下前三个；其余的特定于 ``request`` 跨度，而 ``cb.request`` 则携带其自己的 CacheBlend 的 ``hit_tokens``（前缀 / 分段前缀 / 非前缀）分解。"

#: ../../source/mp/observability/traces.rst:51
msgid "Attribute"
msgstr "属性"

#: ../../source/mp/observability/traces.rst:52
msgid "OTel type"
msgstr "OTel 类型"

#: ../../source/mp/observability/traces.rst:53
msgid "Description"
msgstr "描述"

#: ../../source/mp/observability/traces.rst:54
msgid "``hit_tokens``"
msgstr "``hit_tokens``"

#: ../../source/mp/observability/traces.rst:55
#: ../../source/mp/observability/traces.rst:58
#: ../../source/mp/observability/traces.rst:66
#: ../../source/mp/observability/traces.rst:70
#: ../../source/mp/observability/traces.rst:84
#: ../../source/mp/observability/traces.rst:88
msgid "``int``"
msgstr "``int``"

#: ../../source/mp/observability/traces.rst:56
msgid "Tokens served from L1+L2 (numerator)."
msgstr "从 L1+L2 命中并返回的 token 数（分子）。"

#: ../../source/mp/observability/traces.rst:57
msgid "``requested_tokens``"
msgstr "``requested_tokens``"

#: ../../source/mp/observability/traces.rst:59
msgid "Chunk-aligned tokens submitted for lookup (denominator)."
msgstr "提交查找的块对齐 token 数（分母）。"

#: ../../source/mp/observability/traces.rst:60
msgid "``hit_rate``"
msgstr "``hit_rate``"

#: ../../source/mp/observability/traces.rst:61
#: ../../source/mp/observability/traces.rst:75
#: ../../source/mp/observability/traces.rst:79
msgid "``float``"
msgstr "``float``"

#: ../../source/mp/observability/traces.rst:62
msgid ""
"``hit_tokens / requested_tokens``; ``0.0`` when the denominator is zero."
"  Stored as a precomputed float because trace UIs (Tempo, Jaeger) cannot "
"derive it from two integer attributes at query time."
msgstr ""
"``hit_tokens / requested_tokens``\\ ；当分母为零时取 ``0.0``\\ 。以预计算浮点数形式存储，原因是追踪"
" UI（Tempo、Jaeger）无法在查询时从两个整数属性动态推导该值。"

#: ../../source/mp/observability/traces.rst:65
msgid "``l1_hit_tokens``"
msgstr "``l1_hit_tokens``"

#: ../../source/mp/observability/traces.rst:67
msgid ""
"Tokens in the prefix L1 alone could serve, under each object group's "
"attention window rule.  ``request`` span only."
msgstr "前缀 L1 中的令牌可以在每个对象组的注意力窗口规则下提供，仅适用于 ``request`` 范围。"

#: ../../source/mp/observability/traces.rst:69
msgid "``l2_hit_tokens``"
msgstr "``l2_hit_tokens``"

#: ../../source/mp/observability/traces.rst:71
msgid ""
"Tokens by which L2 extended that prefix.  Together with ``l1_hit_tokens``"
" this is an exact integer partition of ``hit_tokens``.  ``request`` span "
"only."
msgstr "L2 扩展该前缀的令牌。与 ``l1_hit_tokens`` 一起，这是 ``hit_tokens`` 的一个精确整数划分。仅适用于 ``request`` 跨度。"

#: ../../source/mp/observability/traces.rst:74
msgid "``l1_hit_rate``"
msgstr "``l1_hit_rate``"

#: ../../source/mp/observability/traces.rst:76
msgid ""
"``l1_hit_tokens / requested_tokens``; ``0.0`` when the denominator is "
"zero.  ``request`` span only."
msgstr "``l1_hit_tokens / requested_tokens``; ``0.0`` 当分母为零时。 ``request`` 范围内。"

#: ../../source/mp/observability/traces.rst:78
msgid "``l2_hit_rate``"
msgstr "``l2_hit_rate``"

#: ../../source/mp/observability/traces.rst:80
msgid ""
"``l2_hit_tokens / requested_tokens``; ``0.0`` when the denominator is "
"zero.  Sums with ``l1_hit_rate`` to ``hit_rate`` up to float rounding.  "
"``request`` span only."
msgstr "``l2_hit_tokens / requested_tokens``; ``0.0`` 当分母为零时。与 ``l1_hit_rate`` 相加得到 ``hit_rate``，直到浮点数舍入。仅适用于 ``request`` 跨度。"

#: ../../source/mp/observability/traces.rst:83
msgid "``l1_hit_keys``"
msgstr "``l1_hit_keys``"

#: ../../source/mp/observability/traces.rst:85
msgid ""
"Hit keys (one per object group, kv rank and chunk) L1 already held.  "
"``request`` span only."
msgstr "每个对象组、KV 排名和块的命中键（L1 已持有）。仅限 ``request`` 范围。"

#: ../../source/mp/observability/traces.rst:87
msgid "``l2_hit_keys``"
msgstr "``l2_hit_keys``"

#: ../../source/mp/observability/traces.rst:89
msgid ""
"Hit keys loaded from L2.  On hybrid models this can be small while "
"``l2_hit_tokens`` covers the whole hit (L2 supplied only the sliding-"
"window keys).  ``request`` span only."
msgstr "从 L2 加载的命中键。在混合模型中，这可能很小，而 ``l2_hit_tokens`` 覆盖了整个命中（L2 仅提供滑动窗口键）。仅 ``request`` 范围。"

#: ../../source/mp/observability/traces.rst:92
msgid "``early_exit_reason``"
msgstr "``early_exit_reason``"

#: ../../source/mp/observability/traces.rst:93
msgid "``str``"
msgstr "``str``"

#: ../../source/mp/observability/traces.rst:94
msgid ""
"Which branch of the lookup returned before a prefetch was submitted: "
"``no_gpu_context`` or ``no_group_layout_descs`` (nothing registered for "
"this model / world size), or ``empty_chunk_hashes`` (prompt shorter than "
"one chunk).  ``\"\"`` on the normal path, including a genuine cold miss."
"  ``request`` span only."
msgstr "在提交预取之前，查找的哪个分支返回了结果：``no_gpu_context`` 或 ``no_group_layout_descs``（此模型/世界大小没有注册），或 ``empty_chunk_hashes``（提示短于一个块）。正常路径上为 ``\"\"``，包括真正的冷未命中。仅 ``request`` 范围。"

#: ../../source/mp/observability/traces.rst:100
msgid ""
"The attributes are written when ``MP_LOOKUP_PREFETCH_END`` (standard MP "
"path) or ``CB_LOOKUP_END`` (CacheBlend path) is processed — while the "
"root span is still open.  **Store-only requests** that never call "
"``lookup_prefetch_start()`` emit no end event for the lookup phase, so "
"their root span will not carry these attributes."
msgstr ""
"在处理 ``MP_LOOKUP_PREFETCH_END``\\ （标准 MP 路径）或 ``CB_LOOKUP_END``\\ "
"（CacheBlend 路径）时写入这些属性——此时根 span 仍处于打开状态。\\ **纯存储请求**\\ 不会调用 "
"``lookup_prefetch_start()``\\ ，因此不会为查找阶段发出结束事件，其根 span 也不会携带这些属性。"

